# Local Docker labs. The original (v0.1.0..v0.2.0) policy kept the
# entire directory out of the repo. As of v0.3.3 the lab-realistic
# infrastructure (templates, policies, role configs, implant catalog,
# scripts) IS part of the product and lives in the repo; only its
# generated artifacts under lab-realistic/out/ remain ignored. The
# legacy lab/ and lab-large/ playgrounds stay fully ignored.
lab/
lab-large/
lab-realistic/out/

# Benchmark documents under docs/benchmarks/ are committed as of v0.3.0.

# Generated reports (rendered locally, not versioned)
report.html
report.txt

# Cleanup post-sprint v0.2.x: patrones que dejé colarse al repo y que
# no deben volver. Mantener esta sección al final.

# Editor / build-tool transient files
*.tmp
*.clean
*.orig
*.bak

# Random go toolchain umask artefacts
*-go-tmp-umask

# Numeric-suffix backups that some merge tools leave behind
*.go.[0-9]*
*.yaml.[0-9]*

# Top-level lab snapshots (the lab itself stays ignored via lab*/; this
# guards against per-version rendered HTML/text leaking into the root).
/fleet.html
/dossier*.html
/lab-realistic-v*.html
/lab-realistic-v*.txt
/report.html
/report.txt

# Stray binaries at the repo root (proper builds go under /dist/)
/linpersist
/linpersist-report
/detgen
/matrix-audit

# v0.2.x-tune / v0.3.0 cleanup patterns -- prevent leaking sandbox / merge
# / build artefacts into the public history. Keep this section at the end.

# Editor / merge-tool transient files
*.tmp
*.clean
*.orig
*.bak

# Random go toolchain umask artefacts
*-go-tmp-umask

# Numeric-suffix backups some merge tools leave behind
*.go.[0-9]*
*.yaml.[0-9]*

# Top-level lab snapshots (the lab itself is ignored via lab*/; this
# guards against per-version rendered HTML/text leaking into the root).
/fleet.html
/dossier*.html
/informe.html
/lab-realistic-v*.html
/lab-realistic-v*.txt

# Stray binaries at the repo root (proper builds go under /dist/)
/linpersist
/linpersist-report
/detgen
/matrix-audit

# golden test inspection artifacts
internal/testdata/golden/**/*.actual

# blind lab-test (contains the hidden answer)
blindtest/
